            "enlarge_text": true,
            "text": "<p>Calling all pet lovers! 🐾 Oneisall's 4th of July photo contest is fast approaching! 📸 Show off your furry friends in their best, most patriotic poses, or costumes, for a chance to win some pawsome prizes! 🏆 Here's how to enter:</p><p>1. Take an original, new photo of your pet showing off their patriotic spirit with a paper sign \"Pawsome Patriot\" somewhere in the background or in an accompanying photo. </p><p>2. Starting July 1st, you can upload your photo, the deadline for entering is July 11 at 11:59.</p><p>3. Follow, tag, and mention <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/oneisall_official/tagged/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/oneisall_official/tagged/\">@oneisall_official</a> and join our Facebook community to be eligible! Here is the group link to join: <a href=\"https://bit.ly/4blu0OA\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://bit.ly/4blu0OA\">https://bit.ly/4blu0OA</a></p><p>4. The 3 photos with the most comments will win a free <a href=\"https://oneisall.com/products/lm2-dog-grooming-vacuum\" title=\"https://oneisall.com/products/lm2-dog-grooming-vacuum\">Oneisall LM2 pet grooming set</a>. You can also comment on our post and tag your friends.</p>"
